    "customCss": "/* Verdict — theme-level type routing (portable renderer hooks only).\n   The display face does display and H1/H2 work; H3/H4 take the text face so dense cards\n   read as text (T3). Both skins inherit this through their own --body-font. */\n.gml-card h3.gml-heading,\n.gml-card h4.gml-heading {\n  font-family: var(--body-font);\n}\n"
